# title: Call spread (capped call)
# category: Vanillas and digitals
# underlyings: 1
# source: Bouzoubaa & Osseiran, Exotic Options and Hybrids: A Guide to Structuring, Pricing and Trading, Wiley, 2010
# summary: A call whose gain is capped: long a call at the strike, short a call at the cap.
# param: strike = 1.0 | percent | Strike, % of the initial level
# param: cap = 1.2 | percent | Cap, % of the initial level

2027-01-04
    strike = 1.0
    cap = 1.2
    s0 = spot()

2028-01-04
    pays min(max(spot() - strike * s0, 0), (cap - strike) * s0)
